{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Hunter Roulette] \u2013  Multiplayer Strategy &amp; Deadly Bets in a Cyberpunk Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Post-Apocalyptic Cyberpunk: A Feast for the Eyes, a Jolt to the Heart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the cataclysm, the irradiated surface lies silent. Survivors cling to life beneath, packed into a steel-forged city where scarcity rules and profit is the only truth. For the cyber-modified masses, electricity and neon are the new sun, and guns and chips their gospel. Welcome to Hunter Roulette\u2014a brutal game where every shot could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunter Roulette reimagines cyberpunk through the lens of ruin: Colossal machine husks hang broken overhead, data pulses like veins across steel walls, and holographic dealers shout countdowns at betting tables. Each shot tears the air, setting off a dazzling chain of destruction. This is wasteland art\u2014a visual symphony of brutal precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/f468619c8e4c1c59f285a9a8155ba8c9.avif?t=1770271854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras_big/f468619c8e4c1c59f285a9a8155ba8c9.avif?t=1770271854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay: Life-or-Death Mind Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Basic Rules: Odds, Guts, and Wits]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Classic Russian Roulette\u2014Only Crazier:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Gamble: Guns are randomly loaded with live rounds and blanks. Shoot yourself or your opponent. If you survive a self-shot with a blank, you shoot again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanic Innovation: Frenzy Points make offense your best defense. Attack to earn Frenzy Points and strike back even with 0 HP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly Arena: Bet your life\u2014use dozens of props to outsmart, overwhelm, and eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-All Mayhem: Everyone\u2019s your enemy. Take out the weak or keep the balance\u2014it's your call.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300cWicked Props: Your Cheat Codes to Twist Fate\u300d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/6283b0565b8855011c834341a94a95e7.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/6283b0565b8855011c834341a94a95e7.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/6283b0565b8855011c834341a94a95e7.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 game-changing props turn this luck-fest into a battlefield of strategy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Maintenance Kit&quot;: +1 damage this turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Burst Mode&quot;: Shoot twice this turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Spare Magazine&quot;: Force a player to reload. Chain props for explosive combos\u2014buff with &quot;Maintenance Kit&quot;, then unload with &quot;Burst Mode&quot; to flip the match in a flash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Frenzy: Social, Strategic &amp; the Climb to Glory</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300cThree-Player Mayhem: Night of Betrayal\u300d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/fd36ae8450066c069682ddfb5da5415d.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/fd36ae8450066c069682ddfb5da5415d.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/fd36ae8450066c069682ddfb5da5415d.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking new ground with a 3-player brawl\u2014a chaotic free-for-all battlefield:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperation and Betrayal: Ally with the weak to take down the strong\u2014but watch your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bounty Mark&quot;: Tag a threat. Cash in on the kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cDeep Lore: Legends of the Wasteland\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/47f57dc84c797833c17fe277cb25ad77.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/47f57dc84c797833c17fe277cb25ad77.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/47f57dc84c797833c17fe277cb25ad77.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the shadows of the underground city and uncover three faction storylines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wolf Mafia&quot;: Money makes might\u2014crush your foes with an unstoppable income engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Unclean&quot;: They live by the code of desperadoes\u2014weakest, yet deadliest when cornered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;New Theism&quot;: Masters of turning nothing into everything\u2014your salvation when you\u2019ve lost it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cGlobal Rankings: Kings of the Wasteland\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seasonal global race is on\u2014climb the ranks and seize glory:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ranked Challenge&quot;: Climb to the top with win streaks and unlock massive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Survival King&quot;: The longest win streak takes the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Character Master&quot;: Dominate with your main to earn massive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters &amp; Firearms: Where Personality Meets Violent Aesthetics</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300c8 Maniac Heroes\u300d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/87b9aa592e281224491a4ff3f889d016.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/87b9aa592e281224491a4ff3f889d016.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/87b9aa592e281224491a4ff3f889d016.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bioweapon No.13&quot; \u2013 Ultimate: &quot;Private Vodka&quot; \u2013 Turns his Frenzy Points into HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pirate Octopus \u2013 Annie&quot; \u2013 Ultimate: &quot;Bullet Swap&quot; \u2013 Turns someone's blank into a live round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character features exclusive skins, hidden lore, and a solo story mode to uncover their past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cFeel Every Shot: From Kickback to Killshots\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/8bfb28e2a3c8fead77e49aeddee910b0.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/8bfb28e2a3c8fead77e49aeddee910b0.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/8bfb28e2a3c8fead77e49aeddee910b0.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by dynamic, physics-based feedback:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recoil Simulation: Shotgun blasts send your screen shaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive Vibration: Feel the difference between blank thuds and live round cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Diverse Arsenal: Pick from skill-powered guns like the RedSiren (rapid fire) and Carnivore (cash on hit).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Social Mayhem: Break the Rules, Stream the Chaos</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300cBestie Mode: Ride-or-Die\u300d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/f66ad269ffd702d6ffe75285d1280b51.avif?t=1770271854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras_big/f66ad269ffd702d6ffe75285d1280b51.avif?t=1770271854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-Player Teams: Partner up for a 2v2 survival brawl\u2014when your buddy\u2019s bleeding out, patch them up with a transfusion and keep the fight going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Custom Room&quot;: Challenge your friends anytime with a private match.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Ark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/f8f81d7c5ca933472c04ae391c21197094127aaf.jpg"},{"name":"First Shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/a7f7a60d9259f21bb5f7d34f6a4688ad888f6297.jpg"},{"name":"Troublemaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/83b5302af918ae3b5763db16a01f0110b281f0e4.jpg"},{"name":"Top Streak Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/fd7c8b24afb2650cd0a1c233d8eddf355cf2cde7.jpg"},{"name":"Here's a Boom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/86d739f89b0e09149f4686bb8c368a77d326c9eb.jpg"},{"name":"Tried, True, and Trusted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/e1976dd8b7bf7c21e44e216159b3999b6c66ee5d.jpg"},{"name":"Blade Dancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/a9a9d33a7edb534c13886b118c01f0cfce9c8e24.jpg"},{"name":"Toxic Friendship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/9cf355f0c044bb003fe73613f337c8d81874a91a.jpg"},{"name":"The Flash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/008155d513201666444a539dab8cb25bd1659165.jpg"},{"name":"Conquer the Ark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3591550/9d4d8577fcc84f122e466b5e9081b79ec01d7024.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591550?t=1770271854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/7e1aa5c51c4a0982e20eb406f91d1fe06c250c49/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770271854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/81ba0437aa2f037ffdca905a0761d23ba793c3da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770271854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/81ba0437aa2f037ffdca905a0761d23ba793c3da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770271854","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Hunter Roulette] \u2013  Multiplayer Strategy &amp; Deadly Bets in a Cyberpunk Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Post-Apocalyptic Cyberpunk: A Feast for the Eyes, a Jolt to the Heart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the cataclysm, the irradiated surface lies silent. Survivors cling to life beneath, packed into a steel-forged city where scarcity rules and profit is the only truth. For the cyber-modified masses, electricity and neon are the new sun, and guns and chips their gospel. Welcome to Hunter Roulette\u2014a brutal game where every shot could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunter Roulette reimagines cyberpunk through the lens of ruin: Colossal machine husks hang broken overhead, data pulses like veins across steel walls, and holographic dealers shout countdowns at betting tables. Each shot tears the air, setting off a dazzling chain of destruction. This is wasteland art\u2014a visual symphony of brutal precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/f468619c8e4c1c59f285a9a8155ba8c9.avif?t=1770271854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras_big/f468619c8e4c1c59f285a9a8155ba8c9.avif?t=1770271854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay: Life-or-Death Mind Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Basic Rules: Odds, Guts, and Wits]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on Classic Russian Roulette\u2014Only Crazier:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Gamble: Guns are randomly loaded with live rounds and blanks. Shoot yourself or your opponent. If you survive a self-shot with a blank, you shoot again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanic Innovation: Frenzy Points make offense your best defense. Attack to earn Frenzy Points and strike back even with 0 HP!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly Arena: Bet your life\u2014use dozens of props to outsmart, overwhelm, and eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-for-All Mayhem: Everyone\u2019s your enemy. Take out the weak or keep the balance\u2014it's your call.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300cWicked Props: Your Cheat Codes to Twist Fate\u300d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/6283b0565b8855011c834341a94a95e7.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/6283b0565b8855011c834341a94a95e7.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/6283b0565b8855011c834341a94a95e7.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 game-changing props turn this luck-fest into a battlefield of strategy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Maintenance Kit&quot;: +1 damage this turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Burst Mode&quot;: Shoot twice this turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Spare Magazine&quot;: Force a player to reload. Chain props for explosive combos\u2014buff with &quot;Maintenance Kit&quot;, then unload with &quot;Burst Mode&quot; to flip the match in a flash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Frenzy: Social, Strategic &amp; the Climb to Glory</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300cThree-Player Mayhem: Night of Betrayal\u300d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/fd36ae8450066c069682ddfb5da5415d.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/fd36ae8450066c069682ddfb5da5415d.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/fd36ae8450066c069682ddfb5da5415d.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking new ground with a 3-player brawl\u2014a chaotic free-for-all battlefield:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperation and Betrayal: Ally with the weak to take down the strong\u2014but watch your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bounty Mark&quot;: Tag a threat. Cash in on the kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cDeep Lore: Legends of the Wasteland\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/47f57dc84c797833c17fe277cb25ad77.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/47f57dc84c797833c17fe277cb25ad77.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/47f57dc84c797833c17fe277cb25ad77.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the shadows of the underground city and uncover three faction storylines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Wolf Mafia&quot;: Money makes might\u2014crush your foes with an unstoppable income engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Unclean&quot;: They live by the code of desperadoes\u2014weakest, yet deadliest when cornered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;New Theism&quot;: Masters of turning nothing into everything\u2014your salvation when you\u2019ve lost it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cGlobal Rankings: Kings of the Wasteland\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seasonal global race is on\u2014climb the ranks and seize glory:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ranked Challenge&quot;: Climb to the top with win streaks and unlock massive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Survival King&quot;: The longest win streak takes the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Character Master&quot;: Dominate with your main to earn massive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters &amp; Firearms: Where Personality Meets Violent Aesthetics</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300c8 Maniac Heroes\u300d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/87b9aa592e281224491a4ff3f889d016.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/87b9aa592e281224491a4ff3f889d016.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/87b9aa592e281224491a4ff3f889d016.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bioweapon No.13&quot; \u2013 Ultimate: &quot;Private Vodka&quot; \u2013 Turns his Frenzy Points into HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pirate Octopus \u2013 Annie&quot; \u2013 Ultimate: &quot;Bullet Swap&quot; \u2013 Turns someone's blank into a live round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character features exclusive skins, hidden lore, and a solo story mode to uncover their past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cFeel Every Shot: From Kickback to Killshots\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/8bfb28e2a3c8fead77e49aeddee910b0.poster.avif?t=1770271854\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/8bfb28e2a3c8fead77e49aeddee910b0.webm?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/8bfb28e2a3c8fead77e49aeddee910b0.mp4?t=1770271854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by dynamic, physics-based feedback:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recoil Simulation: Shotgun blasts send your screen shaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive Vibration: Feel the difference between blank thuds and live round cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Diverse Arsenal: Pick from skill-powered guns like the RedSiren (rapid fire) and Carnivore (cash on hit).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Social Mayhem: Break the Rules, Stream the Chaos</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300cBestie Mode: Ride-or-Die\u300d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras/f66ad269ffd702d6ffe75285d1280b51.avif?t=1770271854\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/extras_big/f66ad269ffd702d6ffe75285d1280b51.avif?t=1770271854 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-Player Teams: Partner up for a 2v2 survival brawl\u2014when your buddy\u2019s bleeding out, patch them up with a transfusion and keep the fight going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Custom Room&quot;: Challenge your friends anytime with a private match.</p>","developers":["PILI STARSHIP PTE. LTD."],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591550/4d60a425e8c70f1a6cf8164e3ed99045e29085ce/header.jpg?t=1770271854","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3591550/1753670187/a17d8cc8e3ef7b407e943bdff2f65f7cceaf5da2/1750842795/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750845322","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3591550/1753670187/a17d8cc8e3ef7b407e943bdff2f65f7cceaf5da2/1750842795/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750845322","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3591550/1753670187/a17d8cc8e3ef7b407e943bdff2f65f7cceaf5da2/1750842795/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750845322","id":257161226,"name":"Game CG","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161226/ce5800f07d0ca00ed0564e536da12df6a9fecc4e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750845322"},{"dash_av1":"htt